---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import StoryLayout from '../layouts/StoryLayout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import listening from '../../public/images/527589863_18518407312023500_4751277831377556849_n.jpg';
import handshake from '../../public/images/733042320_18601684885023500_8013115927472142937_n.jpg';
import playbookGraphic from '../../public/images/offensive-playbook.webp';
import meeting from '../../public/images/526597981_18518407303023500_453408748168898313_n.jpg';

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
const title = 'My journey into politics | Julia Adele Callahan';
const description = 'Julia Adele Callahan shares why she got involved in politics, her work rebuilding the local Democratic Party, and her vision for the next generation of leadership.';
---
<StoryLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="journey" aria-labelledby="journey-heading">
    <header class="journey-header">


        <div class="section-shell journey-hero "><div class="journey-hero-copy"><h1 id="journey-heading">My journey<br />into politics</h1><p>Julia Adele Callahan</p></div><div class="journey-hero-art"><Image src={playbookGraphic} widths={[360,540,720,1080,1469]} sizes="(max-width:760px) calc(100vw - 40px), 43vw" width={1469} height={1071} format="webp" quality={85} alt="" loading="eager" /></div></div>
      </header>




    <div class="journey-layout section-shell journey-paired journey-alternating">      <nav class="journey-index" aria-labelledby="journey-index-heading">
              <h2 id="journey-index-heading">In this story</h2>
              <a href="#why-i-got-involved">Why I got involved <Arrow /></a>
              <a href="#rebuilding-our-party">Rebuilding our party <Arrow /></a>
              <a href="#the-next-generation">The next generation <Arrow /></a>
            </nav>
      <div class="journey-copy">        <section aria-labelledby="why-i-got-involved"><div class="journey-section-text"><h2 id="why-i-got-involved">Why I got involved</h2>

                <p class="journey-lead">The main reason I got into politics was being denied miscarriage care while Georgia’s six-week abortion ban was being litigated.</p>
                <p>When I was pregnant, I visited a center in Macon offering free ultrasounds. I thought I was getting medical care. Instead, staff told me something was wrong with my baby’s kidneys, information my OB-GYN later confirmed was incorrect. What I had walked into was a crisis pregnancy center, or “fake clinic.” I left frightened about a problem that wasn’t there.</p>
                <p>I began speaking out about fake clinics and the barriers families face when seeking reproductive health care. I cofounded Middle Georgia 4 Choice and shared my story publicly, including at Georgia’s State Capitol. Families deserve accurate information, trustworthy care, and leaders who listen when something goes wrong.</p>
              </div><div class="journey-section-visual"><figure class="journey-photo"><Image src={listening} widths={[360, 540, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), 39vw" width={720} height={960} format="webp" alt="Woman resting her chin on her hand during a meeting." loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Listening at a meeting.</figcaption></figure></div></section>        <section aria-labelledby="rebuilding-our-party"><div class="journey-section-text"><h2 id="rebuilding-our-party">Rebuilding our party</h2>

                <p>After cofounding Middle Georgia 4 Choice, I found our Democratic Party in shambles. I’ve spent the last two years rebuilding our subcommittees, pushing for expanded voting, and rebuilding our get-out-the-vote infrastructure.</p>
                <p>That work helped secure a fourth early voting location, protect the nonpartisan fifth seat, rebuke voter purges, and secure a rewrite to help prevent them from happening again. It also led to a 3.5% increase in primary voting and thousands of doors knocked through programs I’ve spearheaded, including Spooky Voting and Knock Your Block.</p>
                <p>Every Ground Game organizer has publicly endorsed my campaign.</p>
              </div><div class="journey-section-visual"><figure class="meeting-photo">
                  <Image src={meeting} widths={[480, 720, 1000, 1290]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 760px" width={1290} height={1720} format="webp" alt="A woman gestures during a discussion with Sen. Raphael Warnock, seated at left beneath the Georgia state seal." loading="lazy" />
                  <figcaption>A discussion with Sen. Raphael Warnock.</figcaption>
                </figure></div></section>        <section aria-labelledby="the-next-generation"><div class="journey-section-text"><h2 id="the-next-generation">The next generation</h2>

                <p>I’m Gen Z, and I believe it’s time for the next generation to lead and put Democrats on offense. We need to reactivate our post seat holders, bring our Democratic leaders together in a caucus, and build political influence in the Democratic stronghold of Macon-Bibb. With a heavily Republican government, we have to think strategically about how we’re going to win.</p>
                <a class="text-link" href="https://msmagazine.com/author/jcallahan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Julia’s writing <Arrow /></a>
              </div><div class="journey-section-visual"><figure class="journey-photo"><Image src={handshake} widths={[360, 540, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 40px), 39vw" width={720} height={720} format="webp" alt="Woman and man shaking hands in a room with flags." loading="lazy" /><figcaption>A handshake in a room with flags.</figcaption></figure></div></section></div></div>
  </article>
  <section class="campaign-close" aria-labelledby="journey-close-heading">
    <div class="close-layout section-shell">
      <h2 id="journey-close-heading">It’s time to<br />make things happen.</h2>
      <div class="close-copy"><p>It’s time for the next generation to lead. Let’s put Democrats on offense, right here in Bibb County.</p><a class="primary-action" href={`${base}#contact`}>Connect with Julia <Arrow /></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</StoryLayout>
